SUMMARY:R-Ladies+ Melbourne & Statistical Society of Australia (SSA) Networking Event - R-Ladies+ Melbourne
DESCRIPTION:R-Ladies+ Melbourne and the Statistical Society of Australia (SSA) Victoria are excited to bring our communities together for an evening of networking and connection.\n\n**Event details**\n📅 Wednesday 12th of August 2026\n🕕 6:00pm\n📍 Hotel Nacional, Level 3 Rooftop (it is undercover with heaters)\n23-25 Hardware Lane, Melbourne, 3000\n\nIf you use R for programming, data analysis, visualisation, statistics, or you're a statistician looking to connect, this event is for you.\n\nWe're looking forward to bringing our two communities together for a relaxed evening of networking and sharing knowledge and experiences.\n\nWhether you're a regular attendee of either organisation or joining us for the first time, you'll be warmly welcomed.\n\nAnd yes… food will be provided! 🎉\n\n**Please RSVP by 4th of August** (for catering purposes - we kindly ask you update your registration so we can accurately notify the venue and order appropriate amount of food)
LOCATION:Hotel Nacional, 23-25 Hardware Lane, Melbourne CBD, AUSTRALIA
URL:https://www.meetup.com/rladies-melbourne/events/315756564/
ORGANIZER;CN=R-Ladies+ Melbourne:mailto:info@rladies.org
CATEGORIES:RLadies+,R-Ladies+ Melbourne
STATUS:CONFIRMED
