SUMMARY:RLadies+ Albany Kick-Off Meeting - RLadies+ Albany
DESCRIPTION:Albany, NY now has its own RLadies+ chapter!\n\nPlease join us for the Albany Chapter's Kick-Off Meeting on August 6, 2026 at 6 pm in the Community Room at the Albany Public Library Bach Branch on New Scotland Ave. Meet fellow R users of all levels and help determine the direction of this new RLadies+ chapter. You can learn more about RLadies+ at https://rladies.org/.
LOCATION:Albany Public Library - Bach Branch, 455 New Scotland Avenue, Albany, UNITED STATES OF AMERICA
